# This connector's Node core (src/, tests/) reads NO environment
# variables at all -- SuperDocsClient takes its api key as a constructor
# argument, which the Workato adapter supplies from the connection's own
# `api_key` field (entered by the recipe author in Workato's UI, stored
# by Workato's own credential vault -- never in this repo).
#
# The only place a key is ever needed to actually EXERCISE this
# connector against a real SuperDocs account (e.g. manual testing beyond
# the mocked test suite) is a local script you write yourself. If you do
# that, put it here as a name only, never a real value:

SUPERDOCS_API_KEY=your-key-here
